Original authors retain their copyright. The original Apache License 2.0
is preserved in LICENSE. The original README is preserved in README.upstream.md.

BXI Robotics modifications (2026): BXI branding and model selection,
automated model synchronization and reference validation, lossless compressed
and shared model assets, CI packaging, and ESA Pages deployment configuration.
Modified upstream files carry BXI notices or are identified by their BXI package,
workflow, or documentation titles.

Robot URDF/STL assets are sourced from bxirobotics/bxi_controller_ros2.
Their ownership and licensing are separate from this viewer's software license.
The source repository currently has no repository-wide model license declaration.
The viewer license does not grant additional rights to those model assets.

